How overloading is different from overriding? Also find the output for the following code snippet.

```java
class Vehicle
{
    void run()
    {
        System.out.println("Vehicle is running");
    }
}
class Bike2 extends Vehicle
{
    class void run()
    {
        System.out. println ("Bike is running safely");
    }
    public static void main(String args[])
    {
        Bike2 obj = new Bike2();
        obj.run();
    }
}
```

